Teclea Español responsive Spanish typing learner

This project is a modified mobile Spanish learning work based on the training
mechanics of Qwerty Learner:
https://github.com/RealKai42/qwerty-learner

Modifications began on 2026-08-14 and include a new responsive interface,
Spanish input and accent handling, live statistics, lesson data, and interaction design.

